{"server":"cn","storyId":"act8mini_level_act8mini_st05","groupId":"act8mini","stageId":null,"title":"我无惧前路何往","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act8mini/level_act8mini_st05.txt","sourceHash":"2f50cbe5efd4fa14d96109bace08a9ffbed19b3dee14ac3a922e3308afa2fd08","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"凯尔希回想起了与博士相关的往事。眼前这个熟悉而又陌生的人，真的值得她信任吗？是时候在情感上做出抉择了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的说辞并不重要。于每刻践行自己的意志，才算是真正地活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去亲历这片大地吧。独属于你的思想，需要岁月来浇铸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，我希望你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"5:39 P.M. 天气/晴\n室外，罗德岛甲板"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac8mi_sidebyside_dusk"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最近很忙吧，有许多需要处理的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"适当休息也是必要的，你的生理指标近期有一些小的波动，我会持续关注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，煌会在今晚来向你作简报，她主导了昨天的突袭作战。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"narration","text":"1:23 A.M. 天气/雨\n巴别塔临时作战指挥室"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"门外是Scout，他负责了昨夜的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这是他效力于巴别塔后少有的任务失败记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥官，女士，你们都在。我简短说明一下昨晚的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"小队清扫战场时，发现了可追踪的敌军痕迹。我判断这是摸清敌军位置的机会，执意循迹追击而中了埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"责任在我，我愿接受军事处分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是一个老萨卡兹雇佣兵会做出的决断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，那一刻我的经验并没有对我做出警示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"经验不会被没发生的事唤醒。危机发生后，没有队员战死，说明撤退时你的指挥冷静、得当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你应当得到表彰，而非处分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白这个结论是如何得出的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"军队的纪律若不能做到赏罚分明，则失去存在的意义。Scout，这个道理你一定明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么那样在乎她的名誉？我需要一个理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯尔希女士，瑞卡的情况怎么样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经脱离了危险。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Scout想开口说些什么，却欲言又止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"你的内心在斗争着。即使在战场上，也未见你如此为难过。若能说出你的考虑，或许我们可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"我坚持不让瑞卡受到任何处分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"因为她是个孤儿？军队的纪律可承载不了泛滥的同情心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"瑞卡的父亲曾是萨卡兹雇佣兵，死于内战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"这在卡兹戴尔不算什么新鲜事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"瑞卡的母亲身患严重的矿石病，没有抚养她的能力。特蕾西娅殿下知晓此事后，一直为她们家提供经济上的资助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"这也没什么特别的。如果没有更充分的理由......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"瑞卡参军仅是为了报答殿下的恩情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"她曾对我说，为殿下而战是她唯一的愿望，是她生命的全部......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"请说下去，Scout，我在听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......在卡兹戴尔，孩子们难有什么愿望，也难有想守护的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"他们只是被卷入战争，而后战死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你希望保留瑞卡的名誉，延续她守护殿下的愿望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Scout没有回答，身经百战的老兵又回归了沉默。\n博士缓缓起身，伸手拍了拍Scout的肩膀。这是凯尔希没有预料到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"若刚才有任何冒犯，请原谅，我知道你一定会有很好的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我的决定是，没有人会受到处分。但这样的处理结果是对军纪的损害，必定会招致非议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout，我希望你和你的小队在未来用行动回应质疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"一定。指挥官，女士，我先回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"走之前答应我一件事。请至少把自己的生命和名誉，放在与其他队员同等的高度上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"我会的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac8mi_sidebyside_dusk"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......此外，可露希尔或许会找你商讨伦蒂尼姆的问题，她很关心我在这件事上的立场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以和她多分享一些决策过程，毕竟她也是潜在的作战成员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你们也可以......聊些别的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:27 A.M. 天气/晴\n罗德岛总工程师办公室"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这次又是什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，去伦蒂尼姆的事有定论了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"仍在讨论，行动本身确实存在风险。为什么突然关心这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"担心你心情不好呗。我清楚你心底一定想去，却要考虑罗德岛面临的危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"纠结的时候可是最消耗精力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不存在纠结，罗德岛的安全永远在首位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"如果哪天你能随心做想做的事该多好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"这事可瞒不过我，凭你与特蕾西娅的友谊，伦蒂尼姆的事你无法置身事外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"与殿下无关。我只关心行动本身对罗德岛的利弊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是这样，总把责任挂在嘴边，至少偶尔也该关心一下自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦的事丢给博士，咱俩去喝一杯倒倒苦水，多好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士已经很辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒也是，虽然博士失忆前后转变挺大，但工作狂这点可完全没变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，以前的博士可严肃了，还是现在这样比较好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这样比较好欺负？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了，你上次给博士试用的跑步机会无端浮空，必须观看商品促销广告才能降落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是限时大促，是在帮博士省钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你多为博士着想一些。没人想在忙得焦头烂额时再受一些惊吓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，怎么突然这么严肃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是有点怵失忆前的博士吧，我现在总想搞点恶作剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是最后那段日子里，博士的表现越来越古怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"打住，可露希尔，相关话题到此为止。更禁止你对博士提起这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我有分寸。对了凯尔希，去伦蒂尼姆前，我准备开展对“待规划区”的整修，至少得对舰体材料进行加厚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"虽说是一笔很大的开销，但作为可靠的工程师，我认为这点程度的投资还是非常有必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"所以啊，我已经代表工程部决定了，奋战三天三夜，让“待规划区”焕然一新！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"没有必要，“待规划区”是全舰最坚固的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，这我可就有发言权了。“待规划区”的正下方是无人机机库，而机库没有任何支柱的支撑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦上方遭到破坏，机库顶部就会变形，然后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，你干嘛这样盯着我，我害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是自己想去罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我摊牌了，作为总工程师有片区域进不去我好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我有我的考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"总把秘密藏着可是会憋坏的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，什么时候能把你知道的和我分享一些，不要都自己扛着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"或许......会有那么一天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你刚刚是不是松口了！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac8mi_sidebyside_dusk"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"康纳郡的病患安置工作，今天会全部完成。近期需要你重新评估安置点的防卫力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗部晚些时候会把相关数据转交给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"以后类似事务将逐步转交精英干员负责，不分散你在更重要的议题上的精力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉打扰到各位了，大家都醒一醒。凯尔希医生即将开始每日的例行巡房。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的晚间巡房提早了不少呀......欸？还来了好多后勤部的干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你这老忘事的毛病啥时候也该让凯尔希医生给治治咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"医护小姑娘连续一周来咱病房打招呼，说准备把大家转移到康纳郡的临时医疗安置点。你这不是让人家口舌全白费嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不要紧的大伯，毕竟也是比较突然的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这边再唠叨一下，罗德岛本舰近期会在维多利亚周边开展一系列模拟演习。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑到大家的安全，决定将各位暂时转移到康纳郡的医疗安置点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"请大家放心，康纳郡的医护设施齐全，且大部分医护人员也会陪同前往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看，这才是艾莉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊凯尔希医生！您什么时候站我边上的？瞧我这眼神......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不要紧，我也刚到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"艾莉，把这位病人今天的血液检测报告递给我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你恢复得很快，矿石病也没有任何加重的迹象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我能有今天全是托您的福。想当初矿石病急性发作的时候，您可是一天一夜没合眼地抢救，我这才......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是我作为医生的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来要宣读转移安置的相关协议，宣读后需要你在协议上签字。根据《罗德岛矿石病收治规定》第四条......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"医生您歇歇，不用念啦，我完完全全地信任罗德岛，直接让我签字就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢好意。但完整宣读协议也是为了保障你的权益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"艾莉，时间有限，搬运病患的人手可能不太够，去走廊上看看有没有人能帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，博士？下午好呀，您怎么在这里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"下午好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"好久不见。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你现在有空吗？我们这边转移安置病患的人手不太够，可能需要你的帮忙......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有空。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......行。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我非常愿意帮忙。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......以你现在的身体情况，我并不建议你从事体力劳作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"闲着也是闲着。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......我会努力。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"总得让我试试吧！别小看我！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......这不会是罗德岛指挥官吧？就是小艾莉天天挂在嘴边赞不绝口的那位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"大......大叔您可别乱说！博士，我之前只是在向他们介绍罗德岛呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我没她说的那么厉害。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我有这么帅气吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"让罗德岛指挥官给我做转移安置？这使不得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不必推辞，哪怕是最细微的工作，罗德岛所有人也都有义务参与。战地指挥官的头衔并不会改变什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"时间有限，正式开始转移。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"节省时间。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"开始干活吧。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"库斯，你过来抬大伯的上半身，注意医疗设备连接线。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞。艾莉，这台新的仪器是？之前从来没有见过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"融晶仪，莱茵生命CR-01实验型，内置源石回路。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"中晚期矿石病患者体内被结晶填充，脏器易受损破裂。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"融晶仪通过能量的有序集中释放对结晶进行消解。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的没错！我就说吧，博士果然什么都知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"库斯，别那样直接抬。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"库斯，住手。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"库斯，停下！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"左手把患者的双手并拢放在自己颈侧，右手抱紧双腿......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"对......对不起！之前凯尔希医生主讲的战地搬运课程我听得不太认真，很多知识点都没有记住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这种课程本就要靠实践去加深记忆。可博士你又是如何知道的？我记得开课期间你都在萨尔贡出外勤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"下意识就说出口了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"可能我是天才吧。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac8mi_sidebyside_dusk"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一件事，阿米娅近期忙于伦蒂尼姆之行的各项评估，也请你抽出时间关心一下她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她是罗德岛的领袖，但她同时也是个孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:29 A.M. 天气/阴\n巴别塔临时作战指挥室"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是巴别塔的领袖，但同时也是矿石病患者。请重视自己的身体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我建议你停止工作，立刻去休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，你还是这么会关心人......啊，博士，请进来吧，我们没有在讨论机密事项。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我都听到了。殿下，你是该保证足够的睡眠时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚的作战会议气氛很微妙，想必消耗了你大量的精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不必担心。倒是博士，我要为一些与会者的言辞道歉，他们无意冒犯，只是情绪稍有激动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"他们担心我的安全，但我心里明白，博士一定考虑了所有可能的情况。这是最优解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯想夺回战争的主动权。他深知你的优势同时也是你的软肋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"但他想不到的是，你会为萨卡兹人作出多大的牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"当阿斯卡纶率领的部队出现在小镇上时，他将会意识到自己败局已定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你总是这么令人安心。博士，听你说话可比睡一觉让人精神多了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅疲惫的脸上展露出一丝欣慰的笑，这份笑容在她看向门外时变得更加温柔了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"快进来。来这边，坐我边上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娇小的卡特斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可......可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"别探头张望了，这里没有外人，阿米娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，凯尔希医生，晚......晚上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是故意这么晚还没休息的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"没人会责怪你。让我猜猜，做噩梦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不是的。我是听到军队的集合声醒过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"我趴在窗户上看，阿斯卡纶姐姐似乎带着其他战士在为远行做准备......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是有任务在身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......可是阿斯卡纶姐姐说过，她绝对不会离开殿下和我哪怕一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"我担心发生了什么事，就想着偷偷来指挥室看一眼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅呀阿米娅，是博士交给了阿斯卡纶一个小任务，他们不用多久就会回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你想想，博士指挥的战斗，哪一次不是速战速决？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"确......确实，如果是博士的意见，我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"博士是最能给人安全感的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你该休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就回去！大家晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"真是令人怜爱的孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你来之前我确实在担心......阿斯卡纶离开期间罗德岛舰船的安全问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"担心是正常的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"拉长战线的同时，包围一个毫无战略意义的小镇。特雷西斯的真正目的无从得知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我的安危倒是其次，更多的是担心连累到舰上的研究人员和孩子们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"但正如阿米娅所说，你确实能给人带来安全感。在你指挥下所取得的战果也令人无从置疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，凯尔希，战争胜利的那天，应该不远了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac8mi_sidebyside_dusk"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才说的事，都是在你常规日程之外的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你还在听吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我在听。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"听着呢，很清楚。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac8mi_melancholic_kalts"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，怎样才算真正地活着？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这问题有些突然。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......没想过。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"这问题也太深刻了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"服从他人意志，失去前行的理由，这算活着吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那不过是行尸走肉。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"那是机器人吧？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"保有躯体，抽离记忆，又算活着吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那或许会活得有些茫然。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"这说的是我吧？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"若二者择其一，博士，你会如何抉择？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我选择成为人，而非傀儡。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我会选择自由。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"谁会想做机器？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"自由是有代价的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"失去记忆后醒来，被迫去战斗，被迫见证牺牲。一路走来我们并未给你太多选择......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......看着我的眼睛。告诉我，博士，你究竟为何而战？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我为反抗自己的命运而战。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我为罗德岛而战。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我为守护这片大地而战。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那请你不要忘记此刻的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使没有人能理解，我们也必须要这样走下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，而你也会找到你的道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_007_closre","aliases":["可露希尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]}]}
